// The quest book's paths: each age's branches (a quest's `branch` in quests.ron) as the
// lanes the book draws them in, top to bottom, each with a short name and an item for its
// icon. Every branch a quest names needs a path here, and every path a quest on it; the
// names are in the language files too (`quest.path.<age>.<branch>`). A mod's file adds
// paths for its own branches, or gives one already here a new name or icon.
(
    paths: [
        (age: "nomad", branch: "start", title: "First Steps", icon: "stone_axe"),
        (age: "nomad", branch: "main", title: "The Hearth", icon: "campfire"),
